Error [E0205]: Cannot take a write window into `xs`
  --> write_window_requires_mutable_owner_or_write_parameter_2.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     window :: &xs[0]
    |               ^^^^^^
 Why: An unmarked parameter gives read access only; a write window needs the write-access marker `&`
 Fix: Change the parameter to `xs: &[Int]` with the write-access marker `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
